<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Terms of Service — UpNorthHub</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <BaseLayout
      title="Terms of Service"
      description="UpNorthHub terms of service"
      breadcrumbs={[
        { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
        { name: 'Terms', url: '/terms' },
      ]}
    >
      <div class="container-editorial py-12 lg:py-16">
        <header class="border-b border-zinc-200 pb-8 dark:border-zinc-800">
          <span class="badge badge-accent">Terms of Service</span>
          <h1 class="mt-4 font-serif text-4xl font-black text-zinc-900 dark:text-white sm:text-5xl">
            Terms of Service
          </h1>
        </header>

        <main class="prose max-w-none mt-10 prose-p:text-lg prose-li:text-lg prose-headings:font-serif prose-headings:font-bold prose-a:text-accent prose-a:no-underline hover:prose-a:underline prose-img:rounded-xl prose-img:border prose-img:border-zinc-800 prose-code:text-accent prose-code:bg-zinc-900 prose-code:px-1 prose-code:rounded prose-pre:bg-zinc-900 prose-pre:border prose-pre:border-zinc-800 dark:prose-invert">
          <p>
            Last updated: September 2026
          </p>

          <h2>Acceptance</h2>
          <p>
            By accessing and using UpNorthHub (upnorthhub.com), you agree to comply
            with these Terms of Service. If you disagree with any part of these
            terms, you may not access the site.
          </p>

          <h2>Content License</h2>
          <p>
            All original content published on UpNorthHub (articles, tutorials,
            guides, and analyses) is copyrighted by UpNorthHub and Talal Emran.
            You may share articles for non-commercial purposes with proper
            attribution. Commercial redistribution or republishing requires
            written permission.
          </p>

          <h2>User Conduct</h2>
          <p>
            Users may not post content that is illegal, harmful, hateful, or
            infringing. Comments and interactions are moderated. We reserve the
            right to remove any content at our discretion without notice.
          </p>

          <h2>External Links</h2>
          <p>
            UpNorthHub provides links to third-party resources for convenience only.
            We do not endorse or assume liability for the content, accuracy, or
            safety of external sites. Users access third-party resources at their
            own risk.
          </p>

          <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>
            UpNorthHub and its contributors are not liable for any direct,
            indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages
            arising out of or in connection with your use of the site or the
            information contained herein.
          </p>

          <h2>Changes to These Terms</h2>
          <p>
            We may modify these Terms of Service at any time. Changes will be
            effective when posted. Your continued use of the site after such
            changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms. We encourage users
            to review this page periodically.
          </p>

          <h2>Contact</h2>
          <p>
            Questions about these terms? Contact us at <a href="mailto:wm@upnorthhub.com">wm@upnorthhub.com</a>.
          </p>
        </main>
      </div>
    </BaseLayout>
  </body>
</html>